{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Provide funding to offer free continuous glucose monitors to all type 2 diabetic",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "In order to help type 2 diabetics manage glucose levels the government should provide funding to offer continuous glucose monitors to all type 2 diabetics. We think this measure could help save the NHS money by helping to educate and thus reduce diabetic complications such as amputations.",
